[[:db/cas 17592186115730 :question/problem "Calculate $f^{′}(x)$ if $f(x) = x + 3\\arcsecx$." "Calculate $f^{′}(x)$ if $f(x) = x + 3\\operatorname{arcsec} x$."] [:db/cas 17592186115736 :question/problem "Find $f^{′}(x)$ if $f(x) =-\\sqrt{2}\\arccscx$." "Find $f^{′}(x)$ if $f(x) =-\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{arccsc} x$."] [:db/cas 17592186247132 :question/problem "Find the slope of the tangent line to the curve $f(x)=-7arccscx$ at $x=\\sqrt{5}.$" "Find the slope of the tangent line to the curve $f(x)=-7\\operatorname{arccsc} x$ at $x=\\sqrt{5}.$"] [:db/cas 17592186247132 :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of $arccsc$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccscx)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-7arccscx) \\\\  & =-7\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\right) \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent line to the curve $y=f(x)$ at $x=\\sqrt{5}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(\\sqrt{5}) & =\\frac{7}{|\\sqrt{5}|\\sqrt{{\\sqrt{5}}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{\\sqrt{5}\\sqrt{5-1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{2\\sqrt{5}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "The formula for the derivative of $\\operatorname{arccsc} $ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccsc} x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-7\\operatorname{arccsc} x) \\\\  & =-7\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\right) \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent line to the curve $y=f(x)$ at $x=\\sqrt{5}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(\\sqrt{5}) & =\\frac{7}{|\\sqrt{5}|\\sqrt{{\\sqrt{5}}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{\\sqrt{5}\\sqrt{5-1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{2\\sqrt{5}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186247133 :question/problem "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$ if $f(x)=2\\sqrt{x}+5arccscx.$" "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$ if $f(x)=2\\sqrt{x}+5\\operatorname{arccsc} x.$"] [:db/cas 17592186247133 :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of $arccsc$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccscx)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2\\sqrt{x}+5arccscx) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}+5\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccscx) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}+5\\left(-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\right) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}-\\frac{5}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "The formula for the derivative of $\\operatorname{arccsc} $ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccsc} x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2\\sqrt{x}+5\\operatorname{arccsc} x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}+5\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccsc} x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}+5\\left(-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\right) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}-\\frac{5}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186297336 :question/problem "If $f(x)=\\text{arccot }x+\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+1),$ calculate ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}}" "If $f(x)=\\operatorname{arccot} x+\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+1),$ calculate ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/cas 17592186297336 :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of $\\text{arccot}$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\text{arccot }x)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\text{arccot }x+\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+1)) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}+\\frac{2x}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{2x-1}{{x}^{2}+1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "The formula for the derivative of $\\operatorname{arccot} $ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccot} x)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccot} x+\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+1)) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}+\\frac{2x}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{2x-1}{{x}^{2}+1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186315048 :question/problem "Find the slope $m$ of the tangent line to the curve $y=2x+arccotx$ at $x=0.$\n\n$m=$\n{{field-1}}" "Find the slope $m$ of the tangent line to the curve $y=2x+\\operatorname{arccot} x$ at $x=0.$\n\n$m=$\n{{field-1}}"] [:db/cas 17592186315048 :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of $arccot$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccot\\,x)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2x+arccotx) \\\\  & =2+\\left(-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\right) \\\\  & =2-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve at $x=0$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m={y}^{′}(0) & =2-\\frac{1}{1+{0}^{2}} \\\\  & =2-1 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "The formula for the derivative of $\\operatorname{arccot} $ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccot} \\,x)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2x+\\operatorname{arccot} x) \\\\  & =2+\\left(-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\right) \\\\  & =2-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve at $x=0$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m={y}^{′}(0) & =2-\\frac{1}{1+{0}^{2}} \\\\  & =2-1 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186341971 :question/problem "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$ if $f(x)=\\sqrt{x}-2arccscx.$" "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$ if $f(x)=\\sqrt{x}-2\\operatorname{arccsc} x.$"] [:db/cas 17592186341971 :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of $arccsc$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccscx)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\sqrt{x}-2arccscx) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}-2\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccscx) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}-2\\left(-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\right) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}+\\frac{2}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "The formula for the derivative of $\\operatorname{arccsc} $ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccsc} x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\sqrt{x}-2\\operatorname{arccsc} x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}-2\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccsc} x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}-2\\left(-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\right) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}+\\frac{2}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186114947 :question/problem "Calculate $\\dfrac {\\textrm{d}y}{\\textrm{d}x}$ if $y = 2 \\,\\textrm {arccot } x.$" "Calculate $\\dfrac {\\textrm{d}y}{\\textrm{d}x}$ if $y = 2 \\,\\operatorname{arccot}  x.$"] [:db/cas 17592186114947 :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of $\\textrm{arccot}$ is\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d}{\\textrm d x}(\\textrm {arccot } x) \t=  -\\dfrac 1 {1+x^2}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2\\,\\text{arccot }x) \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\text{arccot }x) \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\right) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{1+{x}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "The formula for the derivative of $\\operatorname{arccot} $ is\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d}{\\textrm d x}(\\operatorname{arccot}  x) \t=  -\\dfrac 1 {1+x^2}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2\\,\\operatorname{arccot} x) \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccot} x) \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\right) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{1+{x}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186115533 :question/problem "Calculate $\\frac{dy}{dx}$ for $y = \\frac{\\arcsecx}{e^{x}}$." "Calculate $\\frac{dy}{dx}$ for $y = \\frac{\\operatorname{arcsec} x}{e^{x}}$."] [:db/cas 17592186112208 :answer/value "\\frac{1}{e^{x} \\mid x \\mid \\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}} - \\frac{\\arcsecx}{e^{x}}" "\\frac{1}{e^{x} \\mid x \\mid \\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}} - \\frac{\\operatorname{arcsec} x}{e^{x}}"] [:db/cas 17592186112209 :answer/value "\\frac{\\arcsecx}{e^{x} \\mid x \\mid \\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}}" "\\frac{\\operatorname{arcsec} x}{e^{x} \\mid x \\mid \\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}}"] [:db/cas 17592186112210 :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\mid x \\mid \\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}} - e^{x}\\arcsecx" "\\frac{1}{\\mid x \\mid \\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}} - e^{x}\\operatorname{arcsec} x"] [:db/cas 17592186112211 :answer/value "\\frac{e^{x}\\arcsecx}{\\mid x \\mid \\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}}" "\\frac{e^{x}\\operatorname{arcsec} x}{\\mid x \\mid \\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}}"] [:db/cas 17592186112212 :answer/value "\\frac{e^{x}}{\\mid x \\mid \\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}} - \\frac{\\arcsecx}{e^{x}}" "\\frac{e^{x}}{\\mid x \\mid \\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}} - \\frac{\\operatorname{arcsec} x}{e^{x}}"] [:db/cas 17592186115571 :question/problem "Find $f^{′}(x)$ for $f(x) = \\frac{x^{2} + 1}{\\arccotx}$." "Find $f^{′}(x)$ for $f(x) = \\frac{x^{2} + 1}{\\operatorname{arccot} x}$."] [:db/cas 17592186112388 :answer/value "\\frac{2x\\arccotx + 1}{\\arccot^{2}x}" "\\frac{2x\\operatorname{arccot} x + 1}{\\operatorname{arccot} ^{2}x}"] [:db/cas 17592186112389 :answer/value "\\frac{2x\\arccotx}{\\arccot^{2}x}" "\\frac{2x\\operatorname{arccot} x}{\\operatorname{arccot} ^{2}x}"] [:db/cas 17592186112390 :answer/value "\\frac{\\arccotx - x^{2}}{\\arccot^{2}x}" "\\frac{\\operatorname{arccot} x - x^{2}}{\\operatorname{arccot} ^{2}x}"] [:db/cas 17592186112391 :answer/value "\\frac{x\\arccotx + x^{2}}{\\arccot^{2}x}" "\\frac{x\\operatorname{arccot} x + x^{2}}{\\operatorname{arccot} ^{2}x}"] [:db/cas 17592186112392 :answer/value "\\frac{2x\\arccotx - 1}{\\arccot^{2}x}" "\\frac{2x\\operatorname{arccot} x - 1}{\\operatorname{arccot} ^{2}x}"] [:db/cas 17592186247164 :question/problem "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=\\frac{arccotx}{{x}^{3}}.$" "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=\\frac{\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{3}}.$"] [:db/cas 17592186247164 :question/worked-solution "Here, we let $u(x)=arccotx$ and $v(x)={x}^{3},$ and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\n{u}^{′}(x)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{and}\\,{v}^{′}(x)=3{x}^{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\cdot {x}^{3}-arccotx\\cdot 3{x}^{2}}{({x}^{3})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\frac{{x}^{3}}{1+{x}^{2}}-3{x}^{2}arccotx}{{x}^{6}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\left(\\frac{{x}^{3}+3(1+{x}^{2}){x}^{2}arccotx}{1+{x}^{2}}\\right)}{{x}^{6}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{{x}^{3}+3(1+{x}^{2}){x}^{2}arccotx}{{x}^{6}(1+{x}^{2})} \\\\  & =-\\frac{x+3(1+{x}^{2})arccotx}{{x}^{4}(1+{x}^{2})}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "Here, we let $u(x)=\\operatorname{arccot} x$ and $v(x)={x}^{3},$ and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\n{u}^{′}(x)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{and}\\,{v}^{′}(x)=3{x}^{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\cdot {x}^{3}-\\operatorname{arccot} x\\cdot 3{x}^{2}}{({x}^{3})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\frac{{x}^{3}}{1+{x}^{2}}-3{x}^{2}\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{6}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\left(\\frac{{x}^{3}+3(1+{x}^{2}){x}^{2}\\operatorname{arccot} x}{1+{x}^{2}}\\right)}{{x}^{6}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{{x}^{3}+3(1+{x}^{2}){x}^{2}\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{6}(1+{x}^{2})} \\\\  & =-\\frac{x+3(1+{x}^{2})\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{4}(1+{x}^{2})}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186244919 :answer/value "-\\frac{{x}^{2}-4(1+{x}^{2})arccotx}{{x}^{4}(1+{x}^{2})}" "-\\frac{{x}^{2}-4(1+{x}^{2})\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{4}(1+{x}^{2})}"] [:db/cas 17592186245060 :answer/value "\\frac{x-(1+{x}^{2})arccotx}{{x}^{2}(1-{x}^{2})}" "\\frac{x-(1+{x}^{2})\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{2}(1-{x}^{2})}"] [:db/cas 17592186245112 :answer/value "-\\frac{2x+3(1+{x}^{2}){x}^{2}arccotx}{{x}^{4}(1+{x}^{2})}" "-\\frac{2x+3(1+{x}^{2}){x}^{2}\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{4}(1+{x}^{2})}"] [:db/cas 17592186245953 :answer/value "-\\frac{x+3(1+{x}^{2})arccotx}{{x}^{4}(1+{x}^{2})}" "-\\frac{x+3(1+{x}^{2})\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{4}(1+{x}^{2})}"] [:db/cas 17592186246475 :answer/value "\\frac{2x+3{x}^{2}arccotx}{{x}^{4}(1-{x}^{2})}" "\\frac{2x+3{x}^{2}\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{4}(1-{x}^{2})}"] [:db/cas 17592186247169 :question/problem "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=\\frac{{x}^{2}+4x}{arccscx}.$" "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=\\frac{{x}^{2}+4x}{\\operatorname{arccsc} x}.$"] [:db/cas 17592186247169 :question/worked-solution "Here, we let $u(x)={x}^{2}+4x$ and $v(x)=arccscx,$ and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\n{u}^{′}(x)=2x+4\\,\\text{and}\\,{v}^{′}(x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(2x+4)\\cdot arccscx-({x}^{2}+4x)\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\right)}{{arccsc}^{2}x} \\\\  & =\\frac{2x+4}{arccscx}+\\frac{{x}^{2}+4x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}\\cdot {arccsc}^{2}x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "Here, we let $u(x)={x}^{2}+4x$ and $v(x)=\\operatorname{arccsc} x,$ and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\n{u}^{′}(x)=2x+4\\,\\text{and}\\,{v}^{′}(x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(2x+4)\\cdot \\operatorname{arccsc} x-({x}^{2}+4x)\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\right)}{{\\operatorname{arccsc} }^{2}x} \\\\  & =\\frac{2x+4}{\\operatorname{arccsc} x}+\\frac{{x}^{2}+4x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}\\cdot {\\operatorname{arccsc} }^{2}x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186244573 :answer/value "\\frac{2x+4}{arccscx}+\\frac{{x}^{2}+4x}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}\\cdot {arccsc}^{2}x}" "\\frac{2x+4}{\\operatorname{arccsc} x}+\\frac{{x}^{2}+4x}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}\\cdot {\\operatorname{arccsc} }^{2}x}"] [:db/cas 17592186244829 :answer/value "\\frac{x+4}{arccscx}-\\frac{{x}^{2}+4x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}\\cdot {arccsc}^{2}x}" "\\frac{x+4}{\\operatorname{arccsc} x}-\\frac{{x}^{2}+4x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}\\cdot {\\operatorname{arccsc} }^{2}x}"] [:db/cas 17592186245345 :answer/value "\\frac{4x+2}{arcsecx}+\\frac{{x}^{2}+4x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}\\cdot {arccsc}^{2}x}" "\\frac{4x+2}{\\operatorname{arcsec} x}+\\frac{{x}^{2}+4x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}\\cdot {\\operatorname{arccsc} }^{2}x}"] [:db/cas 17592186246219 :answer/value "\\frac{2x+4}{arccscx}+\\frac{{x}^{2}+4x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}\\cdot {arccsc}^{2}x}" "\\frac{2x+4}{\\operatorname{arccsc} x}+\\frac{{x}^{2}+4x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}\\cdot {\\operatorname{arccsc} }^{2}x}"] [:db/cas 17592186246471 :answer/value "\\frac{{x}^{2}+4}{arccscx}-\\frac{2x+4x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}\\cdot {arccsc}^{2}x}" "\\frac{{x}^{2}+4}{\\operatorname{arccsc} x}-\\frac{2x+4x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}\\cdot {\\operatorname{arccsc} }^{2}x}"] [:db/cas 17592186297338 :question/problem "Find ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\frac{{x}^{2}+5}{arcsec\\,x}.$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}} \n$\\frac{1}{arcsec\\,x}\\,-$\n\n{{field-2}} \n$\\frac{1}{|x|{arcsec}^{2}\\,x}$" "Find ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\frac{{x}^{2}+5}{\\operatorname{arcsec} \\,x}.$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}} \n$\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{arcsec} \\,x}\\,-$\n\n{{field-2}} \n$\\frac{1}{|x|{\\operatorname{arcsec} }^{2}\\,x}$"] [:db/cas 17592186297338 :question/worked-solution "Here, we let $u(x)={x}^{2}+5$ and $v(x)=arcsec\\,x,$ and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\n{u}^{′}(x)=2x\\,\\text{and}\\,{v}^{′}(x)=\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(2x)\\cdot arcsec\\,x-({x}^{2}+5)\\cdot \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}}{(arcsec\\,x)^{2}}. \\\\  & =2x\\,\\frac{1}{arcsec\\,x}-\\frac{{x}^{2}+5}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\frac{1}{|x|{arcsec}^{2}\\,x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "Here, we let $u(x)={x}^{2}+5$ and $v(x)=\\operatorname{arcsec} \\,x,$ and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\n{u}^{′}(x)=2x\\,\\text{and}\\,{v}^{′}(x)=\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(2x)\\cdot \\operatorname{arcsec} \\,x-({x}^{2}+5)\\cdot \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}}{(\\operatorname{arcsec} \\,x)^{2}}. \\\\  & =2x\\,\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{arcsec} \\,x}-\\frac{{x}^{2}+5}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\frac{1}{|x|{\\operatorname{arcsec} }^{2}\\,x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186315060 :question/problem "Find ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\frac{{3}^{x}}{arccsc\\,x}.$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}} \n$\\frac{1}{arccsc\\,x}\\,+$\n{{field-2}}\n$\\frac{1}{|x|{(arccsc\\,x)}^{2}}.$" "Find ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\frac{{3}^{x}}{\\operatorname{arccsc} \\,x}.$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}} \n$\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{arccsc} \\,x}\\,+$\n{{field-2}}\n$\\frac{1}{|x|{(\\operatorname{arccsc} \\,x)}^{2}}.$"] [:db/cas 17592186315060 :question/worked-solution "Here, we let $u(x)={3}^{x}$ and $v(x)=arccsc\\,x,$ and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\n{u}^{′}(x)={3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\,\\text{and}\\,{v}^{′}(x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{({3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3)\\cdot arccsc\\,x-{3}^{x}\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\right)}{{(arccsc\\,x)}^{2}}. \\\\  & ={3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\cdot \\frac{arccsc\\,x}{{(arccsc\\,x)}^{2}}+\\frac{{3}^{x}}{{(arccsc\\,x)}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & ={3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\,\\frac{1}{arccsc\\,x}+\\frac{{3}^{x}}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\frac{1}{|x|{(arccsc\\,x)}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "Here, we let $u(x)={3}^{x}$ and $v(x)=\\operatorname{arccsc} \\,x,$ and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\n{u}^{′}(x)={3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\,\\text{and}\\,{v}^{′}(x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{({3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3)\\cdot \\operatorname{arccsc} \\,x-{3}^{x}\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\right)}{{(\\operatorname{arccsc} \\,x)}^{2}}. \\\\  & ={3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{arccsc} \\,x}{{(\\operatorname{arccsc} \\,x)}^{2}}+\\frac{{3}^{x}}{{(\\operatorname{arccsc} \\,x)}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & ={3}^{x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3\\,\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{arccsc} \\,x}+\\frac{{3}^{x}}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\frac{1}{|x|{(\\operatorname{arccsc} \\,x)}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186341973 :question/problem "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=\\frac{arccotx}{x}.$" "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=\\frac{\\operatorname{arccot} x}{x}.$"] [:db/cas 17592186341973 :question/worked-solution "Here, we let $u(x)=arccotx$ and $v(x)=x$, and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\n{u}^{′}(x)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{and}\\,{v}^{′}(x)=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\cdot x-arccotx\\cdot 1}{{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\frac{x}{1+{x}^{2}}-arccotx}{{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\left(\\frac{x+(1+{x}^{2})arccotx}{1+{x}^{2}}\\right)}{{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{x+(1+{x}^{2})arccotx}{{x}^{2}(1+{x}^{2})}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "Here, we let $u(x)=\\operatorname{arccot} x$ and $v(x)=x$, and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\n{u}^{′}(x)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{and}\\,{v}^{′}(x)=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\cdot x-\\operatorname{arccot} x\\cdot 1}{{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\frac{x}{1+{x}^{2}}-\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\left(\\frac{x+(1+{x}^{2})\\operatorname{arccot} x}{1+{x}^{2}}\\right)}{{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{x+(1+{x}^{2})\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{2}(1+{x}^{2})}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186340302 :answer/value "\\frac{(1+x)arccotx}{x(1+{x}^{2})}" "\\frac{(1+x)\\operatorname{arccot} x}{x(1+{x}^{2})}"] [:db/cas 17592186340458 :answer/value "-\\frac{x+(1+{x}^{2})arccotx}{{x}^{2}(1+{x}^{2})}" "-\\frac{x+(1+{x}^{2})\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{2}(1+{x}^{2})}"] [:db/cas 17592186340917 :answer/value "-\\frac{1+{x}^{2}arccotx}{1+{x}^{2}}" "-\\frac{1+{x}^{2}\\operatorname{arccot} x}{1+{x}^{2}}"] [:db/cas 17592186340931 :answer/value "-\\frac{{x}^{2}+arccotx}{1+{x}^{2}}" "-\\frac{{x}^{2}+\\operatorname{arccot} x}{1+{x}^{2}}"] [:db/cas 17592186341297 :answer/value "\\frac{arccotx}{{x}^{2}(1+{x}^{2})}" "\\frac{\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{2}(1+{x}^{2})}"] [:db/cas 17592186341974 :question/problem "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=\\frac{arccscx}{{e}^{3x}-1}.$" "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=\\frac{\\operatorname{arccsc} x}{{e}^{3x}-1}.$"] [:db/cas 17592186341974 :question/worked-solution "Here, we let $u(x)=arccscx$ and $v(x)={e}^{3x}-1$, and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\n{u}^{′}(x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{and}\\,{v}^{′}(x)=3{e}^{3x}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\cdot ({e}^{3x}-1)-arccscx\\cdot 3{e}^{3x}}{({e}^{3x}-1)^{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{({e}^{3x}-1)|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}-\\frac{3{e}^{3x}arccscx}{({e}^{3x}-1)^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "Here, we let $u(x)=\\operatorname{arccsc} x$ and $v(x)={e}^{3x}-1$, and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\n{u}^{′}(x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{and}\\,{v}^{′}(x)=3{e}^{3x}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\cdot ({e}^{3x}-1)-\\operatorname{arccsc} x\\cdot 3{e}^{3x}}{({e}^{3x}-1)^{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{({e}^{3x}-1)|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}-\\frac{3{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{arccsc} x}{({e}^{3x}-1)^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186339694 :answer/value "\\frac{1}{{e}^{3x}|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}-\\frac{{e}^{3x}arccscx}{{e}^{3x}-1}" "\\frac{1}{{e}^{3x}|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}-\\frac{{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{arccsc} x}{{e}^{3x}-1}"] [:db/cas 17592186340143 :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{({e}^{3x}-1)|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}+\\frac{{e}^{3x}arccscx}{({e}^{3x}-1)^{2}}" "-\\frac{3}{({e}^{3x}-1)|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}+\\frac{{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{arccsc} x}{({e}^{3x}-1)^{2}}"] [:db/cas 17592186340192 :answer/value "-\\frac{{e}^{3x}-1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}+\\frac{3arccscx}{{e}^{3x}({e}^{3x}-1)}" "-\\frac{{e}^{3x}-1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}+\\frac{3\\operatorname{arccsc} x}{{e}^{3x}({e}^{3x}-1)}"] [:db/cas 17592186341104 :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{({e}^{3x}-1)|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}-\\frac{3{e}^{3x}arccscx}{({e}^{3x}-1)^{2}}" "-\\frac{1}{({e}^{3x}-1)|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}-\\frac{3{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{arccsc} x}{({e}^{3x}-1)^{2}}"] [:db/cas 17592186341348 :answer/value "\\frac{3}{{e}^{3x}|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}+\\frac{{e}^{3x}arccscx}{{e}^{3x}-1}" "\\frac{3}{{e}^{3x}|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}+\\frac{{e}^{3x}\\operatorname{arccsc} x}{{e}^{3x}-1}"] [:db/cas 17592186114951 :question/problem "If $f(x) = \\dfrac{\\textrm{arcsec } x}{\\textrm{arccsc } x},$ calculate $f'(x).$" "If $f(x) = \\dfrac{\\operatorname{arcsec}  x}{\\operatorname{arccsc}  x},$ calculate $f'(x).$"] [:db/cas 17592186114951 :question/worked-solution "Here, we let $u(x) = \\textrm{arcsec } x$ and $v(x) = \\textrm{arccsc } x$, and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\nu'(x) =  \\dfrac 1 {|x| \\sqrt {x^2 - 1}}\t\\quad \\text{and} \\quad\tv'(x) = -\\dfrac 1 {|x| \\sqrt {x^2 - 1}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\cdot \\text{arccsc }x-\\text{arcsec }x\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\right)}{{\\text{arccsc }}^{2}x} \\\\  & =\\left(\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{arccsc }x+\\text{arcsec }x}{{\\text{arccsc }}^{2}x} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{arccsc }x+\\text{arcsec }x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}{\\text{ arccsc }}^{2}x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "Here, we let $u(x) = \\operatorname{arcsec}  x$ and $v(x) = \\operatorname{arccsc}  x$, and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\nu'(x) =  \\dfrac 1 {|x| \\sqrt {x^2 - 1}}\t\\quad \\text{and} \\quad\tv'(x) = -\\dfrac 1 {|x| \\sqrt {x^2 - 1}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\cdot \\operatorname{arccsc} x-\\operatorname{arcsec} x\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\right)}{{\\operatorname{arccsc} }^{2}x} \\\\  & =\\left(\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\right)\\frac{\\operatorname{arccsc} x+\\operatorname{arcsec} x}{{\\operatorname{arccsc} }^{2}x} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{arccsc} x+\\operatorname{arcsec} x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}{\\operatorname{arccsc} }^{2}x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186115532 :question/problem "Calculate $\\frac{dy}{dx}$ for $y = e^{3x}\\arcsec(x^{2})$." "Calculate $\\frac{dy}{dx}$ for $y = e^{3x}\\operatorname{arcsec} (x^{2})$."] [:db/cas 17592186112202 :answer/value "e^{3x}(\\frac{2}{x\\sqrt{x^{4} - 1}} - \\arcsec(x^{2}))" "e^{3x}(\\frac{2}{x\\sqrt{x^{4} - 1}} - \\operatorname{arcsec} (x^{2}))"] [:db/cas 17592186112203 :answer/value "e^{3x}(\\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{x^{4} + 1}} + 2x\\arcsec(x^{2}))" "e^{3x}(\\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{x^{4} + 1}} + 2x\\operatorname{arcsec} (x^{2}))"] [:db/cas 17592186112204 :answer/value "e^{3x}(\\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{x^{4} - 1}} + \\arcsec(x^{2}))" "e^{3x}(\\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{x^{4} - 1}} + \\operatorname{arcsec} (x^{2}))"] [:db/cas 17592186112205 :answer/value "e^{3x}(\\frac{3}{x\\sqrt{x^{4} - 1}} - 2\\arcsec(x^{2}))" "e^{3x}(\\frac{3}{x\\sqrt{x^{4} - 1}} - 2\\operatorname{arcsec} (x^{2}))"] [:db/cas 17592186112206 :answer/value "e^{3x}(\\frac{2}{x\\sqrt{x^{4} - 1}} + 3\\arcsec(x^{2}))" "e^{3x}(\\frac{2}{x\\sqrt{x^{4} - 1}} + 3\\operatorname{arcsec} (x^{2}))"] [:db/cas 17592186115534 :question/problem "Calculate $f^{′}(x)$ for $f(x) = \\arcsin x \\cdot \\arccotx$." "Calculate $f^{′}(x)$ for $f(x) = \\arcsin x \\cdot \\operatorname{arccot} x$."] [:db/cas 17592186112214 :answer/value "\\frac{\\arccotx}{\\sqrt{1 + x^{2}}} - \\frac{\\arcsin x}{1 - x^{2}}" "\\frac{\\operatorname{arccot} x}{\\sqrt{1 + x^{2}}} - \\frac{\\arcsin x}{1 - x^{2}}"] [:db/cas 17592186112215 :answer/value "\\frac{\\arccotx}{\\sqrt{1 - x^{2}}} + \\frac{\\arcsin x}{1 + x^{2}}" "\\frac{\\operatorname{arccot} x}{\\sqrt{1 - x^{2}}} + \\frac{\\arcsin x}{1 + x^{2}}"] [:db/cas 17592186112216 :answer/value "\\frac{\\arccotx}{1 + x^{2}} - \\frac{\\arcsin x}{\\sqrt{1 - x^{2}}}" "\\frac{\\operatorname{arccot} x}{1 + x^{2}} - \\frac{\\arcsin x}{\\sqrt{1 - x^{2}}}"] [:db/cas 17592186112218 :answer/value "\\frac{\\arccotx}{\\sqrt{1 - x^{2}}} - \\frac{\\arcsin x}{1 + x^{2}}" "\\frac{\\operatorname{arccot} x}{\\sqrt{1 - x^{2}}} - \\frac{\\arcsin x}{1 + x^{2}}"] [:db/cas 17592186247165 :question/problem "Find ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot arccsc{x}^{2}$" "Find ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\operatorname{arccsc} {x}^{2}$"] [:db/cas 17592186247165 :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of $arccsc$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccsc{x}^{2}) & =-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the product rule and the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccsc{x}^{2})+arccsc{x}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{2x}{{x}^{2}\\sqrt{{x}^{4}-1}}\\right)+arccsc{x}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x \\\\  & =arccsc{x}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{x\\sqrt{{x}^{4}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "The formula for the derivative of $\\operatorname{arccsc} $ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccsc} {x}^{2}) & =-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the product rule and the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccsc} {x}^{2})+\\operatorname{arccsc} {x}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{2x}{{x}^{2}\\sqrt{{x}^{4}-1}}\\right)+\\operatorname{arccsc} {x}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arccsc} {x}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{x\\sqrt{{x}^{4}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186244553 :answer/value "arccscx\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{x\\sqrt{{x}^{4}-1}}" "\\operatorname{arccsc} x\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{x\\sqrt{{x}^{4}-1}}"] [:db/cas 17592186245031 :answer/value "arccsc{x}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{{x}^{2}\\sqrt{{x}^{4}-1}}" "\\operatorname{arccsc} {x}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{{x}^{2}\\sqrt{{x}^{4}-1}}"] [:db/cas 17592186245621 :answer/value "arccsc{x}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{x\\sqrt{{x}^{4}-1}}" "\\operatorname{arccsc} {x}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{x\\sqrt{{x}^{4}-1}}"] [:db/cas 17592186246004 :answer/value "arccsc{x}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{{x}^{2}\\sqrt{{x}^{4}-1}}" "\\operatorname{arccsc} {x}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{{x}^{2}\\sqrt{{x}^{4}-1}}"] [:db/cas 17592186246143 :answer/value "arccscx\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}" "\\operatorname{arccsc} x\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}"] [:db/cas 17592186247168 :question/problem "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=\\operatorname{ln}⁡xarccot{x}^{3}.$" "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\operatorname{arccot} {x}^{3}.$"] [:db/cas 17592186247168 :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of $\\text{arccot}$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccotx)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the product rule, the formula above and the chain rule, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡xarccot{x}^{3}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccot{x}^{3})+arccot{x}^{3}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{3{x}^{2}}{1+{({x}^{3})}^{2}}\\right)+arccot{x}^{3}\\cdot \\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right) \\\\  & =\\frac{arccot{x}^{3}}{x}-\\frac{3{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{1+{x}^{6}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "The formula for the derivative of $\\operatorname{arccot} $ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccot} x)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the product rule, the formula above and the chain rule, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\operatorname{arccot} {x}^{3}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccot} {x}^{3})+\\operatorname{arccot} {x}^{3}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{3{x}^{2}}{1+{({x}^{3})}^{2}}\\right)+\\operatorname{arccot} {x}^{3}\\cdot \\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{arccot} {x}^{3}}{x}-\\frac{3{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{1+{x}^{6}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186244464 :answer/value "\\frac{arccot{x}^{3}}{x}-\\frac{3{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{1+{x}^{6}}" "\\frac{\\operatorname{arccot} {x}^{3}}{x}-\\frac{3{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{1+{x}^{6}}"] [:db/cas 17592186244970 :answer/value "\\frac{arccot3{x}^{2}}{x}-\\frac{{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{1+{x}^{3}}" "\\frac{\\operatorname{arccot} 3{x}^{2}}{x}-\\frac{{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{1+{x}^{3}}"] [:db/cas 17592186245341 :answer/value "\\frac{arccot{x}^{3}}{x}-\\frac{{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{1-{x}^{6}}" "\\frac{\\operatorname{arccot} {x}^{3}}{x}-\\frac{{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{1-{x}^{6}}"] [:db/cas 17592186245411 :answer/value "\\frac{arccot3{x}^{2}}{x}-\\frac{{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{1+{x}^{6}}" "\\frac{\\operatorname{arccot} 3{x}^{2}}{x}-\\frac{{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{1+{x}^{6}}"] [:db/cas 17592186245450 :answer/value "\\frac{arccot{x}^{3}}{x}+\\frac{3{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{1-{x}^{3}}" "\\frac{\\operatorname{arccot} {x}^{3}}{x}+\\frac{3{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{1-{x}^{3}}"] [:db/cas 1759218628